    <h1 class="page-title">Build a real Discord bot visually</h1>
    <p class="lede">Flow is a node IDE for Discord.js. Graphs compile to runnable JavaScript, the simulator traces them without a token, and exports are real Node projects you can host.</p>
  </div>
